==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Will}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but the first toss is guaranteed to be heads rather than the player's choice.

===Origin===
* [[Will]] is a member of the [[Indigo Plateau|Indigo]] [[Elite Four]] in {{game5|Gold|Silver|Crystal|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}.

